From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:11:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/58] ple_offload: standalone fault-injection singleton used
 by the offload transport

A stdlib-only, one-shot, rank-selective fault selector shared by the PLE
offload transport and its tests. Inert unless armed: disarmed, every site is a
single None check outside any compiled or captured region.
